Subject: [PATCH 1/2] refactor(ui): the turning pages draw through the form
 seam

The Threading page's Hand row uses radio_pair and its Spring passes row
uses int_range_row, as the thread milling page does. The field now has
its row's accessible name. The raw-call guard gets a turning family
(turning_page, turning_more_page, turning_start_exit_rows,
thread_infeed_page) at zero.

Pinned by pages_do_not_add_raw_egui_calls_outside_the_form_seam,
form_seam_guard_covers_only_the_migrated_families and
the_spring_passes_field_is_named_by_its_row.

Refs #1122

